@startuml
hide empty description

[*] --> Initiated : payment created

Initiated --> FundsHeld : fraud checks pass &\nwallet has enough funds
Initiated --> Rejected : fraud check fails or\ninsufficient funds

FundsHeld --> SentToBiller : request sent to biller

SentToBiller --> Completed : biller confirms
SentToBiller --> Failed : biller refuses
SentToBiller --> Unknown : no answer within\ntimeout

Unknown --> Completed : biller later confirms\n(callback, retry or\nsettlement file)
Unknown --> Failed : biller later refuses, or\nreconciliation finds\nno payment

Failed --> Refunded : hold released to\nthe wallet

Completed --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]

note right of Unknown
  Never refunded automatically;
  money returns only after confirming
  biller did not receive it.
end note

note right of Completed
  Completed, Rejected, and
  Refunded are final states.
end note
@enduml